# Fixture for tests/unit/test_dialogue_runner.gd: one conversation whose opening depends on quest
# state and a world flag, with a quest mutation and a flag mutation behind its choices.
~ start
if QuestManager.is_quest_complete("clear_eastern_road")
	Tester: Done already.
	=> END
elif QuestManager.get_flag("tester_declined")
	Tester: Back again?
	=> offer
Tester: First line.
Tester: Second line.
=> offer

~ offer
Tester: Will you?
- Yes
	$> QuestManager.start_quest("clear_eastern_road")
	Tester: Good.
- No
	$> QuestManager.set_flag("tester_declined")
	Tester: Fine.
- Hidden choice [if QuestManager.get_flag("never_set") /]
	Tester: You should never see this.
=> END
